      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E005",
        "passage_id": "P005",
        "quote": "the evidence relied upon by the defendants in support of their motion, which included the plaintiff's deposition transcript, failed to demonstrate the defendants' prima facie entitlement to judgment as a matter of law dismissing the complaint on the ground that the plaintiff was unable to identify the cause of her fall without speculation",
