      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E006",
        "passage_id": "P005",
        "quote": "However, the defendants established, prima facie, that they did not create a dangerous or defective condition with respect to the subject parking lot, and did not have actual or constructive notice of the condition alleged by the plaintiff",
