        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Order, Supreme Court, Bronx County (Betty Owen Stinson, J.), entered January 11, 2012, which granted defendants’ motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint, unanimously affirmed, without costs.",
        "statement_status": "current_disposition"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E002",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Defendants established their entitlement to judgment as a matter of law in this action where plaintiff allegedly slipped and fell on an icy condition on defendants’ property.",
