      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Defendants’ testimony that they had shoveled the snow and salted the area after a snowstorm, had salted the area the day before the accident, and left for work via that staircase the morning of the accident and did not see ice or snow, demonstrated that they did not have actual or constructive notice of the icy condition of the back stairs and landing.",
